### How to run

```bash
cd /Users/lily/dev/pi-bench/experiments/frontend-no-rewrite/deepseek-workspace
./start.sh
```

Or manually:

```bash
# Terminal 1 — Backend
java -cp anserini-2.1.1-fatjar.jar io.anserini.api.RestServer --port 8080

# Terminal 2 — Frontend
cd frontend && npm run dev -- -p 3000
```

Then open **http://localhost:3000**.